{"id":5,"title":"About Us","slug":"about-us","url":"/about-us","language":"en","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p><b>Digital Truth News Network 24/7</b> is an independent digital newsroom based in Kerala, reporting on the state, the country and the world.</p>","id":"c3a3a630-6093-451a-9222-a04208b337f6"},{"type":"heading","value":{"text":"What we stand for","level":"h2"},"id":"737984a1-525a-4509-bba7-900f11cac460"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<ul><li>Accuracy before speed</li><li>Fairness to every side of a story</li><li>Corrections published openly</li></ul>","id":"e6d19bb4-966c-4bdf-ae37-7c85d057ddeb"},{"type":"image","value":{"image":{"id":66,"title":"Stock photo by Kelley Bozarth (Picsum #407)","alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"renditions":{"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-407.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-407.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450},"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-407.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900}}},"caption":"Our newsroom (illustrative photo).","credit":"Digital Truth News"},"id":"d1045e3d-bace-49a3-9f5d-f493588eddaa"},{"type":"heading","value":{"text":"Our newsroom","level":"h2"},"id":"09678bc1-81dd-47c5-b49f-3372f4cbcbfb"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>Officials confirmed the details on Monday after a meeting that ran late into the evening. Residents said they had been waiting for clarity for several weeks, and local traders welcomed the announcement. Further steps are expected to be outlined later this week, with a review planned once the first phase is complete.</p>","id":"cc0b372c-e9db-4825-b933-982f9d668458"}],"seo":{"title":"About Us","description":"","canonical_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/about-us"},"updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:03.634054+05:30","layout":"standard","summary":"","last_updated":"2026-11-17","legal